## 4. Deploy-requiring tweak — CNIL daily cadence guard (workers/ingest/src/index.ts)

First production firings revealed cnil-sanctions fetched EVERY 15 min (110 rows/run)
while the pinned plan constraint says "Must NOT: hit CNIL more than daily" and the
adapter contract (T16) states the runner MUST enforce it via isDailyRateOk. Minimal
guard added in runSource (adapter.id === 'cnil-sanctions' && !isDailyRateOk(last_run))
→ skipped:true, no fetch, no failure counted. Verified live: cnil last_run froze at
20:03:17Z (pre-guard run); the 20:15Z firing under fb1b5ba7 inserted 0 cnil rows while
ransomware.live/rss/cert-fr continued normally.

